completed_at: "2026-10-02T18:35:38.110Z"
author: dot
acceptance_criteria: "PTY tests pass for API key, password, editing, cancellation and redirected output; required quality gates remain unchanged."
reporter: dot
severity: medium
environment: Linux PTY; Node 22.13 and 24.19; Bun 1.3.11; synthetic local fixture
repro_steps: Run the isolated setup terminal regression fixture with a synthetic credential.
resolution: Suppress kernel and application terminal echo; restore input modes; handle setup cancellation as structured output with exit status 130.
expected_result: No entered credential appears in terminal or redirected output; cancellation saves nothing.
actual_result: "Final cancellation revision passes six PTY cases on Node 22.13, Node 24.19 and Bun 1.3.11; Bun 1024 passed/185 skipped, portable 1014 passed/1 skipped, release 9 passed, type/lint/build/smoke/secrets pass. Earlier full release aggregate passed; current hosted package smoke remains to be verified after local registry policy blocked the repeat. Windows PTY and injected I/O errors untested."
